  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DefendDefenders CHARM Consortium programme 2023-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">DefendDefenders CHARM Consortium programme 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is the realization of protected and expanded civic space and democratic freedoms for civil society and media to jointly uphold human rights for vulnerable populations.
The overall objective is elaborated through four specific objectives that are designed in a wellintegrated manner in terms of thematic area synchronization and stakeholder participation and coordination:
1. Bolstered advocacy actions that effectively protect civic space, democratic freedoms, and human rights.
2. Amplified counter narratives that are creative, inclusive, and effective in fostering greater public support for human rights and free and accessible civic space
3. Strengthened and innovative intersectional coalition building that promotes joint actions and solidarity within and beyond CHARM.
4.Enhanced access to financial and other resources that increase the tenacity of civil society and media.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka utrymmet f&#xf6;r civilsamh&#xe4;llet och
media att verka fritt fr&#xe5;n hot s&#xe5; att det gemensamt kan bidra till att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r utsatta grupper. Ambassaden bed&#xf6;mer att ramverk som
ligger till grund f&#xf6;r programmet och dess m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r logiskt och robust.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is the realization of protected and
expanded civic space and democratic freedoms for civil society and media to
jointly uphold human rights for vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
